-- bid32_from_string tiny/min-normal rounding-boundary regression rows that are
-- not present in Intel readtest.in. The 8th-significant-digit round-up must
-- keep Intel's dead in-switch coefficient rollover dead (Duff's-device case
-- placement in bid32_string.c), so the biased exponent stays -1 and the
-- underflow path raises UNDERFLOW|INEXACT (status 30). Pinned Intel BID C
-- matches every row; the native comparison runs for this block.

bid32_from_string 0 99999995E-103 [000f4240] 30
